## Skills

Skills live in `.claude/skills/` (generated from `.agents/skills/` — the source of truth).
They auto-trigger by their `description`. After editing a skill in `.agents/skills/`, run
`{% if task_runner == "just" %}just sync-adapters{% else %}node tools/sync-adapters.mjs{% endif %}` to regenerate these copies.

## Subagents

| Agent | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `fg-plan` | Thin wrapper over the `fg-plan` skill (the source of truth). |
| `executor-task` | Implementer for `fg-execute-tasks` — restricted tools (no git), writes only its disjoint scope. |

{% if include_hooks -%}
## Hooks

A PreToolUse hook (`.claude/hooks/block-controller-write.mjs`) guards against the controller
writing source while `fg-execute-tasks` is active and subagents own implementation. It is
**fail-open** (any error allows the write) and gated by the `.forge/.execute-tasks-active`
sentinel, so it is inert during normal work. Tests: `node .claude/hooks/__tests__/run.mjs`.
